{"id":4525,"date":"2025-07-02T03:30:16","date_gmt":"2025-07-02T03:30:16","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=4525"},"modified":"2025-08-11T06:47:07","modified_gmt":"2025-08-11T06:47:07","slug":"cach-huy-don-hang-tren-shopee","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/tin-tuc\/cach-huy-don-hang-tren-shopee\/","title":{"rendered":"C\u00e1ch h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Shopee khi \u0111ang giao, ch\u1edd x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn."},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"Dai2dXZw1oetCxxuG2qlmTHIgH0\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V5XxdcbPSoOyBdxmkMclzUi5g38\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">T\u1eeb l\u00fac &#8220;Ch\u1edd x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn&#8221; \u0111\u1ebfn khi &#8220;\u0110ang giao&#8221;, Shopee \u0111\u1ec1u c\u00f3 quy tr\u00ecnh x\u1eed l\u00fd ri\u00eang. Trong b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft n\u00e0y, N\u1eb9p Gi\u00e1 R\u1ebb s\u1ebd h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea1n c\u00e1ch h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Shopee chi ti\u1ebft, nhanh ch\u00f3ng v\u00e0 \u0111\u00fang quy \u0111\u1ecbnh, k\u00e8m theo nh\u1eefng l\u01b0u \u00fd quan tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u00e1nh m\u1ea5t quy\u1ec1n l\u1ee3i khi mua s\u1eafm. \u0110\u1ecdc ngay c\u00f9ng <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong> \u0111\u1ec3 bi\u1ebft b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n khi n\u00e0o v\u00e0 thao t\u00e1c ra sao!<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HjYAdnLybouD6LxVQgYltQPNgqd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-UoYtd5gntoRIGtxOCwslVFQAgTd\" style=\"text-align: left;\">1. \u0110\u01a1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Shopee khi \u0111ang giao, ch\u1edd x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn c\u00f3 h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c kh\u00f4ng?<\/h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4527\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4527\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4527\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/52.png\" alt=\"Tr\u00ean Shopee, kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng s\u1ebd ph\u1ee5 thu\u1ed9c v\u00e0o tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/52.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/52-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/52-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/52-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/52-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4527\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Tr\u00ean Shopee, kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng s\u1ebd ph\u1ee5 thu\u1ed9c v\u00e0o tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XkckdR2Xsohl8kxzIpDlEu1TgWg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u01a1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Shopee khi \u0111ang giao ho\u1eb7c \u0111ang \u1edf tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i \u201cCh\u1edd x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn\u201d c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c, nh\u01b0ng c\u00f3 \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3 t\u00f9y theo t\u1eebng giai \u0111o\u1ea1n:<\/div>\n<h3 class=\" old-record-id-DFAQdWWbgoz5ANxDHPZln2Q8g9b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"divider\"><strong>1.1. Tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i \u201cCh\u1edd x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn\u201d<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OeQ1d3uFiof6vcxj4bNlPydggcd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u1ede giai \u0111o\u1ea1n n\u00e0y, ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1ef1 h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng. Ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n v\u00e0o m\u1ee5c \u201cT\u00f4i\u201d \u2192 \u201c\u0110\u01a1n mua\u201d \u2192 ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u01a1n \u0111ang ch\u1edd x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn \u2192 ch\u1ecdn \u201cH\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng\u201d, sau \u0111\u00f3 ch\u1ecdn l\u00fd do h\u1ee7y v\u00e0 x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn. H\u1ee7y th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng s\u1ebd kh\u00f4ng \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng g\u00ec n\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n kh\u00f4ng l\u1ea1m d\u1ee5ng qu\u00e1 nhi\u1ec1u l\u1ea7n.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVFxdsAamo9PV6xXMaVlWEnygyf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">N\u00ean h\u1ee7y c\u00e0ng s\u1edbm c\u00e0ng t\u1ed1t tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01a1n ho\u1eb7c b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\" old-record-id-LsY4dXgAvohQMExE72Il9TGMgfh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"divider\">1.2. <strong>Tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i \u201cCh\u1edd l\u1ea5y h\u00e0ng\u201d ho\u1eb7c \u201c\u0110ang giao\u201d<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LQLHdU1Rko0QwSxl3z0lggpYgKg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u1ebfn \u0111\u00e2y, b\u1ea1n kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 t\u1ef1 h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng n\u1eefa. Tuy nhi\u00ean, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SNC4d4RDFo5wauxowHnloRQ7g6f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Li\u00ean h\u1ec7 v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n: \u0110\u1ec3 y\u00eau c\u1ea7u h\u1ee7y n\u1ebfu h\u1ecd ch\u01b0a b\u00e0n giao cho \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NMZddWhHto9y6MxrUjhl26kfgpb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u1eeb ch\u1ed1i nh\u1eadn h\u00e0ng khi giao \u0111\u1ebfn: \u0110\u00e2y \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c xem l\u00e0 c\u00e1ch h\u1ee7y gi\u00e1n ti\u1ebfp. Khi b\u1ea1n t\u1eeb ch\u1ed1i nh\u1eadn, h\u00e0ng s\u1ebd b\u1ecb ho\u00e0n v\u1ec1 v\u00e0 Shopee s\u1ebd ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n (n\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 thanh to\u00e1n tr\u01b0\u1edbc).<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P6W9duEkCoHsbAx8bYVlCNUDgLf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Vi\u1ec7c h\u1ee7y \u1edf tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i \u0111ang giao c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 khi\u1ebfn t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n b\u1ecb Shopee \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 th\u1ea5p n\u1ebfu l\u1eb7p l\u1ea1i nhi\u1ec1u l\u1ea7n. Do \u0111\u00f3, n\u00ean ki\u1ec3m tra k\u1ef9 \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi \u0111\u1eb7t.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CObAdBcbqoPIs4xDuGvlqwcXgIf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-CmptdRaJaoF0MLxE4akl4YRegQd\" style=\"text-align: left;\">2. C\u00e1ch h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Shopee khi h\u1ee7y tr\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i so v\u1edbi m\u00e1y t\u00ednh?<\/h2>\n<p>Vi\u1ec7c h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Shopee c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n tr\u00ean c\u1ea3 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i (app) v\u00e0 m\u00e1y t\u00ednh (trang web). Tuy nhi\u00ean, giao di\u1ec7n v\u00e0 thao t\u00e1c c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec3m kh\u00e1c nhau.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-UXKfderthoE3mdxPd2klNDvLgp6\" style=\"text-align: left;\">2.1 H\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i (\u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng Shopee)<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QXBBdOIN0oClLVxgMDYluWJGgRc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: M\u1edf \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng Shopee \u2192 V\u00e0o tab &#8220;T\u00f4i&#8221; (g\u00f3c d\u01b0\u1edbi b\u00ean ph\u1ea3i)<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JjR9dPUiaoA2ZYxTMMFlJGXqgte\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: Ch\u1ecdn m\u1ee5c &#8220;\u0110\u01a1n mua&#8221; \u2192 Ch\u1ecdn tab &#8220;Ch\u1edd x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn&#8221;<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KsRdd8jcooRMRwxqYC3lrXBKg6f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: Nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o \u0111\u01a1n c\u1ea7n h\u1ee7y \u2192 K\u00e9o xu\u1ed1ng ch\u1ecdn &#8220;H\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng&#8221;<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OsB3dnMhvo3QeixGw52lTQVqgrf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 4: Ch\u1ecdn l\u00fd do h\u1ee7y \u2192 Nh\u1ea5n X\u00e1c nh\u1eadn<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DR4RdGblAolLlOxHmXhlVyXxgSe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 5: Ki\u1ec3m tra tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng trong tab &#8220;\u0110\u00e3 h\u1ee7y&#8221; \u0111\u1ec3 x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn h\u1ee7y th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4529\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4529\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4529\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/40.png\" alt=\"N\u1ebfu \u0111\u01a1n \u0111\u00e3 chuy\u1ec3n sang tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i \u201c\u0110ang chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb h\u00e0ng\u201d ho\u1eb7c \u201c\u0110ang giao\u201d, b\u1ea1n kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 h\u1ee7y \u2014 ch\u1ec9 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1eeb ch\u1ed1i nh\u1eadn h\u00e0ng.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/40.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/40-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/40-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/40-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/40-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4529\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">N\u1ebfu \u0111\u01a1n \u0111\u00e3 chuy\u1ec3n sang tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i \u201c\u0110ang chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb h\u00e0ng\u201d ho\u1eb7c \u201c\u0110ang giao\u201d, b\u1ea1n kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 h\u1ee7y \u2014 ch\u1ec9 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1eeb ch\u1ed1i nh\u1eadn h\u00e0ng.<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-XzAgdALQyoP6yyxHWmul90CCgEg\" style=\"text-align: left;\">2.2. H\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean m\u00e1y t\u00ednh (website Shopee)<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N1ShdKlKPoOW5UxcA4NlIJMHgJc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: Truy c\u1eadp <a href=\"https:\/\/shopee.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https:\/\/shopee.vn<\/a> \u2192 \u0110\u0103ng nh\u1eadp t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AJyRdfczToFXzIx0MD5lFwmsgld\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: Nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o t\u00ean t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n (g\u00f3c ph\u1ea3i tr\u00ean c\u00f9ng) \u2192 Ch\u1ecdn &#8220;\u0110\u01a1n mua&#8221;<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FmCBdYJq2ofJBCx1t8ZlOvjZgIc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: Trong m\u1ee5c &#8220;Ch\u1edd x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn&#8221;, nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng c\u1ea7n h\u1ee7y<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWIrdIyKbopX8AxZOkIlYzWkgGg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 4: Ch\u1ecdn &#8220;H\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng&#8221; \u2192 Ch\u1ecdn l\u00fd do v\u00e0 x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QbcUdVe27oR0fgx9cFFl15Lcg3e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 5: Ki\u1ec3m tra tab &#8220;\u0110\u00e3 h\u1ee7y&#8221; trong &#8220;\u0110\u01a1n mua&#8221; \u0111\u1ec3 x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c h\u1ee7y.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bqh4dsdHEo5alExGcGRlMaNqgne\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-FhiYdwyfNohgaBxX8wRlSbrugoe\" style=\"text-align: left;\">3. \u0110i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N4QedfpZUocbMpx0twGlWmm9gce\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u1ea1n ch\u1ec9 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng khi \u0111\u01a1n \u0111ang \u1edf tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i &#8220;Ch\u1edd x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn&#8221;. Trong giai \u0111o\u1ea1n n\u00e0y, h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng ch\u01b0a chuy\u1ec3n th\u00f4ng tin \u0111\u1ebfn ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n ho\u1eb7c ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n ch\u01b0a x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng. N\u1ebfu \u0111\u01a1n \u0111\u00e3 chuy\u1ec3n sang tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i &#8220;Ch\u1edd l\u1ea5y h\u00e0ng&#8221;, &#8220;\u0110ang giao&#8221; ho\u1eb7c &#8220;\u0110\u00e3 giao&#8221;, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 t\u1ef1 h\u1ee7y m\u00e0 ph\u1ea3i li\u00ean h\u1ec7 tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n \u0111\u1ec3 xin h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3, ho\u1eb7c ch\u1edd \u0111\u01a1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c giao r\u1ed3i ti\u1ebfn h\u00e0nh tr\u1ea3 h\u00e0ng\/ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n theo ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-OQ42dhjrloxbfqxjHnjlnd4egwh\" style=\"text-align: left;\">3.1. Th\u1eddi gian \u0111\u1ec3 h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JQ8VdjgyCoWIDtxPJ4olVdWFgfg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Khi \u0111\u01a1n \u1edf tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i &#8220;Ch\u1edd x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn&#8221;:<\/strong> B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ed9ng h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 l\u00fac n\u00e0o, mi\u1ec5n l\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n ch\u01b0a x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EQLrdU37KoaquNxFAVqlzNhbg7c\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Th\u1eddi gian x\u1eed l\u00fd: H\u1ee7y th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng ngay sau khi b\u1ea1n x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn, \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng chuy\u1ec3n sang tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i &#8220;\u0110\u00e3 h\u1ee7y&#8221; trong v\u00f2ng v\u00e0i gi\u00e2y.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Sad4d42hlo9zcMxNK6GlUUcBgQd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n (n\u1ebfu \u0111\u00e3 thanh to\u00e1n): Ti\u1ec1n ho\u00e0n v\u00e0o v\u00ed ShopeePay trong 1-3 ph\u00fat, ho\u1eb7c th\u1ebb ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng\/t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n li\u00ean k\u1ebft trong 7-14 ng\u00e0y, t\u00f9y ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c thanh to\u00e1n.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KD8pdRfsSozZ6VxYJD4lNktzg0f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Sau khi ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn:<\/strong> \u0110\u01a1n chuy\u1ec3n sang tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i &#8220;Ch\u1edd l\u1ea5y h\u00e0ng&#8221;, l\u00fac n\u00e0y vi\u1ec7c h\u1ee7y s\u1ebd ph\u1ee5 thu\u1ed9c v\u00e0o ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i t\u1eeb ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n, ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1eeb ch\u1ed1i nh\u1eadn h\u00e0ng khi shipper giao \u0111\u1ebfn (trong tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p COD).<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PihNdjon0ojUA8xbnrilK212gyc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Th\u1eddi gian x\u1eed l\u00fd:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QY9Fd7SocoQTGAxCrsKlulqUgHc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>N\u1ebfu ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n \u0111\u1ed3ng \u00fd: \u0110\u01a1n h\u1ee7y trong v\u00f2ng 1-2 gi\u1edd sau khi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ch\u1ea5p nh\u1eadn, tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i chuy\u1ec3n sang &#8220;\u0110\u00e3 h\u1ee7y&#8221;.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HGMEdHJihoWaivxvZodlpVNogce\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>N\u1ebfu ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n t\u1eeb ch\u1ed1i: B\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n li\u00ean h\u1ec7 Shopee qua t\u1ed5ng \u0111\u00e0i 19001221 ho\u1eb7c m\u1ee5c &#8220;Tr\u00f2 chuy\u1ec7n&#8221; \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3. Th\u1eddi gian x\u1eed l\u00fd c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 k\u00e9o d\u00e0i th\u00eam 1-2 ng\u00e0y.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K055dyXlioqUJ0xlaBClkEiIgYc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>N\u1ebfu \u0111\u01a1n \u0111\u00e3 \u1edf tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i &#8220;\u0110ang giao&#8221;, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1eeb ch\u1ed1i nh\u1eadn h\u00e0ng khi shipper giao, sau \u0111\u00f3 y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n (th\u1eddi gian x\u1eed l\u00fd: 1-3 ng\u00e0y).<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DDfYd7dWboGpYjx4q6dlr2v3gph\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n: T\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u1ef1 nh\u01b0 tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i &#8220;Ch\u1edd x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn&#8221;, ti\u1ec1n ho\u00e0n v\u00e0o v\u00ed ShopeePay (1-3 ph\u00fat) ho\u1eb7c th\u1ebb ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng (7-14 ng\u00e0y). N\u1ebfu \u0111\u01a1n \u0111\u00e3 giao, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 c\u1ea7n tr\u1ea3 h\u00e0ng v\u1ec1 \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-GUoSdZGu3oDF4yxzt10lHpufgcb\" style=\"text-align: left;\">3.2. T\u00ecnh tr\u1ea1ng \u0111\u00e3 thanh to\u00e1n tr\u01b0\u1edbc (qua th\u1ebb, v\u00ed ShopeePay), Ch\u1edd x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn, Ch\u1edd l\u1ea5y h\u00e0ng, \u0110ang giao, \u0110\u00e3 giao?<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SY6Ud9R5ropo6gx7IR3lJrY7gHg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">N\u1ebfu \u0111\u00e3 thanh to\u00e1n tr\u01b0\u1edbc (qua th\u1ebb ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng, ShopeePay&#8230;): H\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng, Shopee s\u1ebd ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng v\u1ec1 ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 d\u00f9ng (ShopeePay, t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng&#8230;) trong 1\u20137 ng\u00e0y l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c t\u00f9y ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O5QFdCaDLoaAGHxWbu1l4tKSgLf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">V\u1edbi \u0111\u01a1n COD (thanh to\u00e1n khi nh\u1eadn h\u00e0ng): H\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n h\u01a1n, ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n thao t\u00e1c trong m\u1ee5c &#8220;\u0110\u01a1n mua&#8221;.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YYuCdkJMzoSa4rx695tlouU2g8f\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-Qxtfd389JoWe0RxEzGjl07S8gTh\" style=\"text-align: left;\">4. H\u1eadu qu\u1ea3 v\u00e0 ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n<\/h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4528\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4528\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4528\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/53.png\" alt=\"T\u00f9y v\u00e0o c\u00e1ch nh\u1eadn ho\u1eb7c tr\u1ea3 h\u00e0ng - h\u1eadu qu\u1ea3 v\u00e0 ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n s\u1ebd kh\u00e1c nhau\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/53.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/53-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/53-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/53-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/53-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4528\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">T\u00f9y v\u00e0o c\u00e1ch nh\u1eadn ho\u1eb7c tr\u1ea3 h\u00e0ng &#8211; h\u1eadu qu\u1ea3 v\u00e0 ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n s\u1ebd kh\u00e1c nhau<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkgddXyMmoNwKfx2oholrTaGgDc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">H\u1eadu qu\u1ea3 khi vi ph\u1ea1m ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch tr\u1ea3 h\u00e0ng\/ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n tr\u00ean Shopee, t\u1eadp trung v\u00e0o kh\u00eda c\u1ea1nh ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-G4bkdrgdWoP6zCxdL82l1Ns3gSH\" style=\"text-align: left;\">4.1. H\u1eadu qu\u1ea3 khi h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Shopee<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WajQdRMMLoAUxOxvNEhlYLJIgo9\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t l\u00e0 sau khi ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n \u0111\u00e3 x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u01a1n \u0111ang giao, Shopee c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n l\u00e0 c\u00f3 h\u00e0nh vi mua h\u00e0ng kh\u00f4ng nghi\u00eam t\u00fac. M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng c\u00f3 l\u1ecbch s\u1eed h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n qu\u00e1 nhi\u1ec1u c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 b\u1ecb h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng m\u00e3 gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1, voucher ho\u1eb7c th\u1eadm ch\u00ed kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c tham gia m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i t\u1eeb Shopee. H\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n \u0111\u1ed9t ng\u1ed9t khi\u1ebfn ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n b\u1ecb l\u1ed7 chi ph\u00ed \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i, v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n ho\u1eb7c m\u1ea5t c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u1eabn \u0111\u1ebfn xung \u0111\u1ed9t gi\u1eefa ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua v\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-HfFjdimB0oErRXxABt2lDMHVgvf\" style=\"text-align: left;\">4.2. <strong>Ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n c\u1ee7a Shopee<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Sphkd4cIkoYndyxhUcOlgiAnglh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div>H\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n:<\/div>\n<div>\u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi thanh to\u00e1n qua ShopeePay: Ti\u1ec1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n v\u1ec1 v\u00ed ShopeePay trong t\u1ed1i \u0111a 24 gi\u1edd.<\/div>\n<div>\u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi th\u1ebb ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng ho\u1eb7c v\u00ed \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed kh\u00e1c: Shopee s\u1ebd ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n v\u1ec1 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n trong 3\u20137 ng\u00e0y l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c (t\u00f9y theo ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng).<\/div>\n<div>\u0110\u01a1n h\u00e0ng b\u1ecb ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n h\u1ee7y: N\u1ebfu ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 giao h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ed9ng h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n, ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua c\u0169ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 nh\u01b0 tr\u00ean.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DLbgd9QEnoqbxxxjLp7lRqEngXg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n m\u1ed9t ph\u1ea7n: Trong tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng c\u00f3 nhi\u1ec1u s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 ch\u1ec9 1 ph\u1ea7n \u0111\u01a1n b\u1ecb h\u1ee7y, Shopee ch\u1ec9 ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n t\u01b0\u01a1ng \u1ee9ng v\u1edbi gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m b\u1ecb h\u1ee7y.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E0oTdQlF2ou9y0x8sxslPKHjgNd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">L\u01b0u \u00fd: Ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng c\u1ea7n theo d\u00f5i th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o trong m\u1ee5c \u201cT\u00f4i &gt; \u0110\u01a1n mua &gt; \u0110\u00e3 h\u1ee7y\u201d \u0111\u1ec3 bi\u1ebft tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZjURdj7eloaUQpxUMOTlToFGglf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dai2dXZw1oetCxxuG2qlmTHIgH0\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ks8gd6p04owNoOxWWZbl0RgjgBh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FEXqdgjf1oGfffxkAUslZSzCgYg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OksvdNEJBox3r8xE4YklklKwgJz\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QMAJd6O27oHyLLxpLOel45C6gWV\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Email: <\/strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wwn6dEOtuoxChIxMWupl6nQhgJd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Website: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AxITdFWZtoSMHExFZuql6wRig5f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>T\u1eeb l\u00fac &#8220;Ch\u1edd x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn&#8221; \u0111\u1ebfn khi &#8220;\u0110ang giao&#8221;, Shopee \u0111\u1ec1u c\u00f3 quy tr\u00ecnh x\u1eed l\u00fd ri\u00eang. Trong b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft n\u00e0y, N\u1eb9p Gi\u00e1 R\u1ebb s\u1ebd h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea1n c\u00e1ch h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Shopee chi ti\u1ebft, nhanh ch\u00f3ng v\u00e0 \u0111\u00fang quy \u0111\u1ecbnh, k\u00e8m theo nh\u1eefng l\u01b0u \u00fd quan tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u00e1nh m\u1ea5t quy\u1ec1n l\u1ee3i khi [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":4770,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[30,1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-4525","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-kien-thuc-shopee","category-tin-tuc"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/